            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Navuzwa inzi manyi vindu viosi kigira ivi; chokolaa kandi hoosi huzizaa. Inzi manyi kuli oveeye nu vutima vululu ligali ni inzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mali konyoora makuva gu vutima vuvwo ku inzi kandi mbuliyi liegingira liilio ku inzi, ndavika endoani mu amuulu googo, kandi lijamu mu munwa mumwo na ndakwiranyira kunzira ya waazira ku.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Isaya yavolera mwami Hezekia, “Yiki ne kelolero cha makuva gazizaa kwekoleka. Muhiga gunu nu muhiga guzaa mulava vuzwa nuvuswage vwu mbulimu, navuzwa mu muhiga gwa kavaga, mulataga uvuswage vwinyu aveene nokovogesa, kandi mulasimika vizabibu nukulia mazabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yavo avalitigala vihiiri yi Ivuyuda valamedeka kuva vanyingi kuli misaala jihilaa miri musi mu malova nukwama makuyu malahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halava ho navandu mu Jerusalemi kandi ku kiguru cha Ziyoni avalitigala mwoyo, kigira Yahova Wuvunyali usaaviyi kokora ivindu yivi viekoleke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yaga nigo ga Yahova amali kovora kigira Mwami wa Asiria: ‘Sialingira mu lidaala linene yili anoho kulasa losele lulala lwuvuta ku lidaala linene yili mba. Avasikari vatumikira zikuuti sivalaza ahimbi ni lidaala linene yili mba; kandi si valumbaka vitumi viamalova viukukumbirizira lidaala yili mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliranira kunzira ya yaazira ku, vugira kwingira mu lidaala yili. Inzi Yahova mali kovora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakinga kandi ndahonyia lidaala yili, kigira luyali lwange mwene kandi kigira lisuuviriza lia ndalomba ku mutumikiri wange Daudi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
