          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engelosi ya Yahova yazia hokososa ha vandu va Asiria ma ni yita avasikari 185,000. Mugambazuri lidiku lialonda ku, vosi vaali avakuzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Senakeribu mwami yirana namenya mu lidaala linene lia Nineve. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lidiku lilala, lwa yaali nasigamira munyasaye mu litembeli liu munyasaye weve uwalangwa Nisiroki, avayaayi veve vaviri, Adirameleki na Sharezeri, vamwita nivivavi viavo, ma nivahalira mu kivala cha Ararati. Muyaayi wundi walangwa Esarihadoni - yamiha mu vogono vwivwe kuli mwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
